---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Boon Jin" description="About Boon Jin, creator of Deck.Toys and Smoothboard.">
  <section class="page-heading">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I am Boon Jin, a Singapore-based solo founder building practical classroom tools.
      My work includes Smoothboard and Deck.Toys, products used by more than 100,000
      teachers worldwide.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="about-body">
    <img src="/images/classroom-ai-singapore.png" alt="A classroom scene with Singapore in the background and students using digital classroom tools." />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I am interested in the part of EdTech where the product has to survive the
        real classroom: limited time, mixed student readiness, different devices,
        and teachers who need practical help instead of more complexity.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I write about AI, EdTech, product building, and the
        everyday decisions behind building Deck.Toys.
      </p>
      <p>
        The current focus is practical AI for teachers: helping turn existing
        material into usable lesson activities, reducing preparation time, and
        keeping the teacher in control.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
